  "body": "Proudly positioned on a corner site in the heart of Gulf Harbour, this impressive home warmly welcomes extended families with its blend of space, comfort, and effortless multi-generational living.\r\n\r\nDesigned with seamless entertaining at its core, the floor plan centers around a sleek, modern kitchen equipped for the home chef, flowing directly into light-filled open-plan living and dining areas. Outside, a generous deck offers the ultimate setting for summer barbecues and alfresco hosting, while the pristine garden beyond provides a peaceful outdoor retreat.\r\n\r\nThe layout accommodates every generation in comfort and style, boasting six bedrooms and five bathrooms. This includes three complete master suites - each with its own private ensuite and walk-in robe - alongside two additional family bathrooms. Upstairs, a dedicated lounge creates a quiet secondary sanctuary to work, unwind, or relax independently while taking in elevated views towards the marina.\r\n\r\nLiving here puts coastal convenience right at your doorstep. Take a short drive to the Gulf Harbour Marina for a stress-free ferry commute to the Auckland CBD. Outstanding schooling options are moments away, including Wentworth College, Wentworth Primary, and Gulf Harbour Primary, alongside local cafes, Whangaparaoa Golf Course, and stunning beaches.\r\n\r\nSubstantial homes of this caliber are rare to find. Whether you require dedicated work-from-home options, guest accommodation, or space for extended family, 52 Resolution Drive delivers on every level.",
